 "bodyText": "Live Batches\nTime Bound Test\nMock Test\nStudy Material\nCart\nSignup/Login\nLive Batches\nTime Bound Test\nMock Test\nStudy Material\nCart\nSignup/Login\nFREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS\n1. What makes CDS Journey different from other coaching platforms?\nWe focus on concept-based learning rather than rote memorization. Our structured classes, high-quality study material, and personalized mentorship ensure that students are exam-ready.\n2. Do you provide study material along with the classes?\nYes, we provide comprehensive PDFs, notes, and quizzes for each subject, along with recorded classes for revision.\n3. How can I enroll in a batch?\nYou can visit our website cdsjourney.com and go to the ‘Live Batches’ section to enroll in upcoming courses.\n4. How do I access class recordings?\nAll recorded classes are available inside the app. Simply log in with your registered ID to access the recordings anytime.\n5. How do I purchase a batch?\nSelect the batch you want to enroll in and add it to the cart.\nGo to the cart section and proceed to checkout.\nComplete the payment process to confirm your enrollment.\n6. Is there any free content available?\nYes! We provide a range of free resources to help aspirants:\nFree High-Quality YouTube Lectures – Covering all subjects with PYQ analysis.\nFree Digital Notes – Well-structured, exam-oriented study material.\nFree Mock Tests – Practice with exam-level questions for better preparation.\n7. How can I contact CDS Journey for queries?\n📧 Email: support@cdsjourney.com\n📞 Call/WhatsApp: +91 9198151228\n\nStill have questions? Contact us:\n\n📧 support@cdsjourney.com | 📞 +91 9198151228\n\nx\nCorporate Address: 5/543 sector 5 Gomti Nagar Extension, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh (226010)\n\nEmail - support@cdsjourney.com\n\n© 2024 CDS Journey: All rights reserved.\n\nCompany\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nContact Us\n\nHelp & Support\n\nTerms Conditions\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nRefund/Cancellation Policy\n\nFAQ's\n\n© Designed by Cds.Journey",
